---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="About" description="Radziszewski Software is run by Rafał Radziszewski, a backend engineer and consultant.">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<p>
		{site.name} is run by Rafał Radziszewski, a backend engineer with over a decade of experience, mostly
		on new products and in early-stage teams.
	</p>
	<p>
		Most of his experience is in distributed systems and backend development, and more recently in LLM-based
		products. He has worked mostly in Elixir, but also in Ruby, Python and TypeScript. He has a strong
		interest in the theoretical foundations of computer science and in interactive programming in the Lisp tradition,
		and prefers simple software that is
		deliberately not overengineered.
	</p>
	<p><a href={site.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a> · <a href={site.github}>GitHub</a></p>
</Base>
